{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/32022","id":3983280077,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKALCgc7tbAfN","html_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/32022","diff_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/32022.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/32022.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/32022","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/32022/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/32022/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/32022/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/statuses/9737816b910e58edb6c9c5c6d8acdcb7e4386f4d","number":32022,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(auth): deny model access for teamless keys with all-team-models","user":{"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","id":158243242,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Relevant issues\n\nRelated to #30737 and PR #29746\n\n## Pre-Submission checklist\n\n- [x] I have added meaningful tests\n- [x] My PR passes all CI/CD checks (e.g., lint, format, unit tests)\n- [x] My PR's scope is as isolated as possible; it only solves 1 specific problem\n- [ ] I have requested a Greptile review by commenting `@greptileai` and received a **Confidence Score of at least 4/5** before requesting a maintainer review\n\n## Screenshots / Proof of Fix\n\nTo reproduce the bug and verify the fix, start a local proxy with at least one model configured and create a teamless key with `all-team-models`:\n\n```bash\n# create a teamless key with all-team-models\ncurl -s http://localhost:4000/key/generate \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $LITELLM_MASTER_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"models\": [\"all-team-models\"]}' | jq .\n\n# before fix: this succeeds (bug) - the key can call any model despite having no team\n# after fix: this returns 403 key_model_access_denied\ncurl -s http://localhost:4000/v1/chat/completions \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $GENERATED_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"hi\"}]}'\n```\n\n## Type\n\nBug Fix\n\n## Changes\n\nPR #29746 fixed `get_key_models` so that a key with `all-team-models` but no `team_id` returns an empty model list. However, two call-path functions still unconditionally skip key-level model checks when `all-team-models` is present, without checking whether the key actually belongs to a team:\n\n1. `_enforce_key_and_fallback_model_access` (the main auth entry point for `/chat/completions` etc.) had `elif \"all-team-models\" in valid_token.models: pass` - skipping the model check entirely regardless of team membership\n\n2. `can_key_call_resolved_model` (used by realtime endpoints and post-resolution checks) set `skip_key_model_check = True` whenever `all-team-models` was present, again without a team_id guard\n\nBoth now require `valid_token.team_id is not None` to skip the check. Teamless keys fall through to `can_key_call_model`, which via `_resolve_key_models_for_auth_check` correctly treats the unresolvable sentinel as a non-matching string and denies access\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/68804be8677b4a0c9033e7c2663281bc\nRequested by: @mateo-berri\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> Tightens proxy authorization on a sensitive path; behavior change only for teamless keys that incorrectly had `all-team-models`, which should now get 403 instead of unrestricted access.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Closes an auth bypass where **virtual keys with `all-team-models` but no `team_id`** could call any model because two paths skipped key-level checks whenever that sentinel appeared.\n> \n> **`can_key_call_resolved_model`** and **`_enforce_key_and_fallback_model_access`** now only skip those checks when **`valid_token.team_id is not None`**. Teamless keys run **`can_key_call_model`**, which denies access via the unresolved sentinel. Tests assert **`key_model_access_denied`** for teamless `all-team-models` on both paths.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 9737816b910e58edb6c9c5c6d8acdcb7e4386f4d. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-03T04:10:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:19:47Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T04:34:37Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T04:34:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"dfbbda4f199ff4cbe49c6f5924c856661953681b","assignee":{"login":"mateo-berri","id":277851410,"node_id":"U_kgDOEI-tEg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277851410?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri","html_url":"https://github.com/mateo-berri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"mateo-berri","id":277851410,"node_id":"U_kgDOEI-tEg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277851410?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri","html_url":"https://github.com/mateo-berri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateo-berri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"BerriAI:litellm_fix-teamless-all-team-models-call-bypass","ref":"litellm_fix-teamless-all-team-models-call-bypass"